  "worked_solution": "Of the given options, we consider the row operation    \n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & \\,-4 & \\,\\,-2 \\\\ 0 & \\,-1 & \\,4 \\\\ 2 & \\,2 & \\,1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}2 & \\,-4 & \\,\\,-2 \\\\ 0 & \\,-1 & \\,4 \\\\ 3 & \\,0 & \\,0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}.\n$$",
